 Akrai, Kasmenai etc) to encompass all of eastern Sicily, reaching as far as Gela and Agrigento. The ground floor covers prehistory through to the end of the Classical period. Upstairs includes Hellenistic and Roman Syracuse and a display of material from the catacombs. A gallery displaying material from Hellenistic eastern Sicily is in preparation.",{"settlement":87,"region":87,"country":126,"address":127,"geo":128},"Italy","Viale Teocrito 66, 96100 - Siracusa",{"lat":129,"lon":130},37.07636989,15.2866213,{"_":132,"type":133},"49737","inventory",{"_":135,"mainLang":136,"languages":137},"Ancient Greek","grc",[135],{"type":139,"bibl":140},"edition",[17],{"type":142,"bibl":143},"discussion",[17],{"editor":145,"principal":148,"contributors":149,"change":153},{"_":146,"ref":147},"Jonathan Prag","#JP",{"_":146,"ref":147},[150],{"_":146,"xml:id":151,"ref":152},"JP","http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537",{"_":154,"when":155,"who":147},"Jonathan Prag created file from autopsy","2026-05-18","",{"n":108,"url":109,"height":110,"width":111,"desc":112,"surfaceType":113},[159,161],{"atLeast":160,"atMost":160},22,{"atLeast":162,"atMost":163},15,16,[],[],[167,168,169,19,24,28,170,171,172,173,174,175,136],"isic002139","fragment of a greek funerary inscription",{"_":5},"syracusae","siracusa","sicilia","sicily","museo archeologico regionale paolo orsi","ancient greek",[],{"title":178,"body":179,"divs":180,"editions":205,"images":215,"handnote":227},"ISic002139. Fragment of a Greek funerary inscription","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2014-09-09, cassette 2, magazzino B, Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χρηστ\">χρη[στ\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ἄ\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">μ͡ε\u003C/span>μ̣[πτ\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ἐβίω[σε \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>·Μ̣[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2014-09-09, cassette 2, magazzino B, Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χρηστ\">ΧΡΗ[..\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>...]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>Α\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Μ͡Ε\u003C/span>.[..\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΕΒΙΩ[..\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>·.[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002139_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic002139_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002139.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic002139-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002139_rear_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic002139_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002139_rear.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic002139_rear-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text based on autopsy\u003C/span>\u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"1\">1: \u003Cspan>The ending of χρηστὸς is uncertain\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"2\">2: \u003Cspan>The ending of ἄμεμπτος is uncertain (and the alternative spelling ἄμενπτος also possible)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"4\">4: \u003Cspan>N is just possible, but there is no trace of the vertical to the right.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>[----] worthy and blameless, lived [---]\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The name of the deceased is missing from above line 1. The formula χρηστὸς καὶ αμ̓́εμπτος is distinctive to the Syracusan region. The verb ἐβίωσε(ν) instead of ἔζησε(ν) is relatively rare, although attested in use in Sicily. The Μ preceded by an interpunct in the final line is likely to be a numeral from the age of the deceased, with ἔτη to be restored at the end of line 3.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">\u003Cp>V-cut letters with wedge serifs; use of ligature; quadrate epsilon, uncial omega.\u003C/p> Line 2  22  Line 3  15-16  Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[181,184,187,190,193,196,199,202],{"id":182,"html":183},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2014-09-09, cassette 2, magazzino B, Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χρηστ\">χρη[στ\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ἄ\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">μ͡ε\u003C/span>μ̣[πτ\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ἐβίω[σε \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>·Μ̣[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2014-09-09, cassette 2, magazzino B, Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"χρηστ\">ΧΡΗ[..\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>...]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>Α\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Μ͡Ε\u003C/span>.[..\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. 1-2.\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΕΒΙΩ[..\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>·.[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":185,"html":186},"facsimile-images","\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002139_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic002139_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002139.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2014-09-09\" src=\"ISic002139-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002139_rear_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - 